# M4.29.2 root healthcheck identity

Date: 2026-08-28

## Symptom

The corrected Agentmode unit was installed and produced a fresh valid external
observation. The subsequent explicit Agent Health invocation reported
`CONTROL_LOCAL_STATE_INVALID`, after which the fail-closed trap stopped all
three maintenance services.

## Cause

The operational transaction invoked `tu1nz_agent_health.sh` as root. Its
read-only `--check` delegates to Git, and Git correctly refused the
`chatops`-owned Control checkout. The persistent Agentmode unit itself runs as
`chatops` and had already completed its probe successfully.

## Impact

- corrected unit installed with the manifest-bound hash;
- Agentmode stopped after the transaction trap;
- Integrity and Monitor restart not reached;
- Control unchanged;
- Adult Candidate unchanged and never started.

## Resolution

Run the explicit Health validation as `chatops` with `runuser`, matching the
service identity. Do not weaken Git ownership protections. Revalidate the
already-installed unit hash before restarting the maintenance services.
